; Radio Mobile "Rainbow colors" 11-level Signal Palette (radiomobile.dcf)
; Matches exact Radio Mobile scale: < -100 to -60 dBm (step 4 dB)
; Format: dBm: red, green, blue
 -60: 255,  50,  90
 -64: 255, 100, 100
 -68: 255, 220, 100
 -72: 255, 255, 100
 -76: 192, 255, 100
 -80: 100, 255, 100
 -84: 100, 255, 100
 -88: 100, 255, 192
 -92: 100, 255, 255
 -96: 100, 220, 255
-100:   0,  38, 255
